                            "name":  "places/ChIJ_6v6xhWpQjQRq8kQTzsl8Ks/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvc0lqempRRRAB",
                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                            "rating":  4,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "As others have pointed out, the nine sampler set is super delicious and varied. And the fried rice is just so delicious. A must try in my book. The accompanying miso soup was ok. The three piece dessert was really well made, although not my taste preference.\n\nThe place is super cozy; I really enjoyed the atmosphere. And the staff is friendly and helpful!\n\nOn service, one comment is that I was asked to pay when the dessert was served - not in advance of the meal and not after. This ruins the experience somewhat.\n\nIn summary, I’m flagging The carp as a favorite place to eat in Taipei and hope to visit again! With a wish that maybe next time payment can be handled a bit more elegantly.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "As others have pointed out, the nine sampler set is super delicious and varied. And the fried rice is just so delicious. A must try in my book. The accompanying miso soup was ok. The three piece dessert was really well made, although not my taste preference.\n\nThe place is super cozy; I really enjoyed the atmosphere. And the staff is friendly and helpful!\n\nOn service, one comment is that I was asked to pay when the dessert was served - not in advance of the meal and not after. This ruins the experience somewhat.\n\nIn summary, I’m flagging The carp as a favorite place to eat in Taipei and hope to visit again! With a wish that maybe next time payment can be handled a bit more elegantly.",
                                                 "languageCode":  "en"
                                             },
