                        {
                            "name":  "places/ChIJ2f2uZkSrQjQRQkyLoMW8d44/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aVFZETlBhMmR2YkY5R2RYRmFTR0UyWkUxUFVXYxAB",
                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "The shop owner, staff, and staff were all very friendly.\n\nThe food was delicious; the sweetness of the curry came entirely from vegetables and fruits,\n\nso sometimes the flavor might be slightly different 😂. You could definitely feel the care they put into the food.\n\nThey also had special latte sauce and pickled shallots,\n\nwhich added a wonderful aroma to the curry and made the texture even smoother—super cool!",
                                         "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "店狗和老闆、闆娘都很和善\n餐點也很好吃，咖哩的甜味全都用來自蔬菜水果\n所以有時候口味會有點不一樣😂\n完全可以感受到對餐點的用心\n還有特別的拿鐵醬和蕗蕎漬，\n加進咖哩裡面香香的，口感也更滑順，超酷的",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
                            "authorAttribution":  {
                                                      "displayName":  "Amelia",
                                                      "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112461925896919109223/reviews",
                                                      "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJgNz1C3KqakfC2YF7s9liHT6VSVNUrDLC6TiGJWucbtytlxuT=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                                                  },
                            "publishTime":  "2026-01-01T09:56:57.378808961Z",
                            "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aVFZETlBhMmR2YkY5R2RYRmFTR0UyWkUxUFVXYxAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                            "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aVFZETlBhMmR2YkY5R2RYRmFTR0UyWkUxUFVXYxAB!2m1!1s0x3442ab4466aefdd9:0x8e77bcc5a08b4c42"
                        },
                        {
                            "name":  "places/ChIJ2f2uZkSrQjQRQkyLoMW8d44/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFltWkphV016TUVKNmRtNWpXRXRCUzFwME1IYxAB",
                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "This curry rice \u0026 cafe combo is truly amazing!\n\nMy friend said their curry is cooked with the other ingredients, making the meat incredibly flavorful! The vegetable curry I had was also very generous with its toppings, and the special latte sauce added another layer of flavor. If you\u0027re still hungry, you can get more rice and sauce!\n\nSince it also has cafe service, I opted for tea since I can\u0027t have coffee in the evening, but look! Their tea was also exquisite and delicious!\n\nThe staff at the cafe are very friendly! You can even touch them!",
                                         "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "這家咖哩飯 x 咖啡廳真的令人驚艷！\n一起吃的朋友說他們的咖哩是跟著料一起煮的，所以肉超入味！我吃蔬菜咖哩的料也很豐富，還有特製的拿鐵醬可以淋上去又是另一層風味。吃不飽還可以加飯加醬好欸！\n畢竟還有咖啡廳的服務，晚上不能喝咖啡的我只好點個茶了但是你看！他們的茶也很精緻好喝！\n店裡的夠勾很親近人！可以摸摸！",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
                            "authorAttribution":  {
                                                      "displayName":  "莎菲爾Sapphire",
                                                      "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107314151922777657193/reviews",
                                                      "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWg-zQwIrwu8qrr91h3q4-wURAEz9KOn6L4hT2xtTjN-sS__WGQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
                                                  },
                            "publishTime":  "2026-02-25T11:26:45.705614410Z",
                            "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFltWkphV016TUVKNmRtNWpXRXRCUzFwME1IYxAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                            "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFltWkphV016TUVKNmRtNWpXRXRCUzFwME1IYxAB!2m1!1s0x3442ab4466aefdd9:0x8e77bcc5a08b4c42"
                        }
