                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Super nice and friendly staff, very attentive throughout the visit.\nThe coffee was excellent — you can really taste the quality of the beans.\n\nThe kimchi pork wrap was very tasty. The wrap was crunchy and smelled great, and all the ingredients were in a perfect combination. Everything was just right.\n\nThe Chestnut Mont Blanc was not too sweet and had a very good chestnut flavour. Really enjoyable overall.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
