                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Good value buffet for dim sum and many other Chinese dishes for $720NT/person. We arrived 11:05 am for lunch, but it was already packed full. Fortunately, they gave us a table in the corner. There are many selection of dim sum and various meats (bbq pork, roast duck, Beijing beef, etc). We felt that dim sum and other dishes were good, but not the best. However, there\u0027s many appetizers, salads, main popular dishes, desserts, fruits, drinks, and even ice creams. They even have 5 different hot tea pots you can enjoy.  Overal, it\u0027s a great value for the variety and good quality of buffet!  Make sure to make reservations.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
