                            "rating":  2,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "We ordered sets but didn\u0027t find the dishes too great for the price. I think the ingredient quality and flavor could be improved.\n\nAppetiser: Salad with duck breast: 3/5\n- Decent but the presentation could be improved\n\nTomato cream soup: 4/5\n- Pretty good, I might only suggest adding a garnish on top, like parsley, but it\u0027s not required\n\nSpaghetti with beef: 3/5 (not pictured)\n- The flavor is a bit plain for my liking, maybe this dish could have spices added.\n\nNZ steak entree: 3/5\n- it\u0027s kind of weird, and wet, and the presentation isn\u0027t so good. Quality is just ok too.\n\nDesserts: 3/5\nThe homemade ice cream is great! I think other desserts are ok, we had tiramisu and Panna Cotta.\n\nThe service is great, and I appreciate the staff.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
