                            "name":  "places/ChIJ9SiNiIyuQjQRqaE-rwnU6i4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Nd2EyTjFlVFpEYkVrNExYRklNbkl0TldFM01XYxAB",
                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 個月前",
                            "rating":  4,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "小夜市附近的平價義大利麵店，現在還能有這個價格並提供濃湯與飲料自助已經很稀有了。\n飲料部分有茶跟奶茶，味道上比較水一點。濃湯味道不錯，裡面的玉米跟火腿也都還算豐富，湯體澱粉感不會很重，也不會太奶容易膩。\n麵體部分是Q彈的，但是鴨肉比較乾微微硬。燉飯的部分更像青醬泡飯，汁沒甚麼收乾，米粒沒有吸到醬汁，帶是裡面的雞胸肉蠻軟的，不柴。\nIt\u0027s a cheap spaghetti restaurant near the small night market of 石牌. At this price, it\u0027s very rare for them to offer free drinks and soup.\nThe drinks are slightly watery, both tea and milk tea. The soup is good with much corn and ham. It\u0027s not too starchy or too milky, which can be overwhelming..\nThe noodles are springy; however, the duck is slightly rough. The risotto is more similar to porridge. The broth is not dry; the rice has not absorb the sauce, even if the chicken chest is soft and not dry.",
                                         "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "小夜市附近的平價義大利麵店，現在還能有這個價格並提供濃湯與飲料自助已經很稀有了。\n飲料部分有茶跟奶茶，味道上比較水一點。濃湯味道不錯，裡面的玉米跟火腿也都還算豐富，湯體澱粉感不會很重，也不會太奶容易膩。\n麵體部分是Q彈的，但是鴨肉比較乾微微硬。燉飯的部分更像青醬泡飯，汁沒甚麼收乾，米粒沒有吸到醬汁，帶是裡面的雞胸肉蠻軟的，不柴。\nIt\u0027s a cheap spaghetti restaurant near the small night market of 石牌. At this price, it\u0027s very rare for them to offer free drinks and soup.\nThe drinks are slightly watery, both tea and milk tea. The soup is good with much corn and ham. It\u0027s not too starchy or too milky, which can be overwhelming..\nThe noodles are springy; however, the duck is slightly rough. The risotto is more similar to porridge. The broth is not dry; the rice has not absorb the sauce, even if the chicken chest is soft and not dry.",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
