                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Came here via verbal recommendation from my cousin and this place exceeded my expectations in every way.\n\nThe food was just superb, we ordered the uni and the shrimp and asparagus hand rolls (both were excellent, especially the shrimp and asparagus), the katsu sando, mentaiko and their featured crab sando, and they all exceeded expectations in the best way possible.\n\nReservation strongly recommended as we saw many walk-in parties get turned away due to the small size of the restaurant. This place is an absolute must try!!",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
