                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "This restaurant is a nice option for families with young children. It has a large ball pit for kids to play in, and safety guards are installed on all staircases. Hygiene is well maintained, with sanitisation required before entry. There’s also a separate area for children under two. The restrooms have a diaper-changing station, and the sinks include small steps for kids. The staff are friendly and helpful. Highly recommended for parents looking for a safe and enjoyable place to dine with their little ones.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
