                            "rating":  4,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Delicious springy ramen in bei tou. I love their fried mochi! They serve beer and sake.\nThey are open at 11.30am and make sure you are there early as the restraunt fills up within minutes. It\u0027s on a first come first serve basis.\nIf you manage to win a bell game, you get 50% off the fried tofu dish. Fun!\nService wise is efficient and ambience  wise, brings me back to 100 years ago in Japan. Overall a great experience.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
