                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "The food was delicious, the chili peppers were amazing!\n\nThe atmosphere was comfortable and pleasant. Highly recommend! 💗",
                                         "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "餐點都很好吃，辣椒超讚！\n環境氣氛是舒服的 ～～推推💗",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
