                                         "text":  "First time dining here and I thought we needed a reservation to dine. They allow walk-ins and the waiting time is actually fast.\n\nFood was super good, and the service was really fast and they were able to attend to our every need/request despite the volume of customers. They even suggested better food combinations when we place our orders.\n\nOverall, we had a really good time and will definitely come visit again when we come back to Taipei.",
