                            "rating":  4,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Arrived around 7:00PM and got in right away. We all ordered individual beef noodle soup and dumplings to share. I ordered a large and i couldn\u0027t finish all the noodles. The noodles had a nice al dente chewiness to them. The beef was nice and tender. I\u0027ve had richer more complex broths but it was still good.\n\nThe plump dumplings were freshly boiled and arrived hot.\n\nThe noodles and dumplings are a great  value.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
