                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "This beef noodle shop offers great value. The beef is served in large, tender chunks that are easy to eat, and the noodles have a nice chewy texture. The broth is flavorful and aromatic without being overpowering. A big plus is the efficient seating system—there’s usually no queue, and the food comes out fast. It’s a casual local spot with quick service. They also provide chili butter and pickled greens for self-service. Great choice for a quick, tasty, and affordable meal.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
