                            "name":  "places/ChIJCdBOMP6rQjQRPExzFfbBQ9k/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pad2VWSTVVVzE0TUUwNVNpMDBSeTFzZDBSRGRsRRAB",
                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                            "rating":  3,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Coffee was actually really really good and smooth, tasted amazing. Me and my husband ordered 1 coffee and 1 ice cream but were told ice cream did not count as a drink so we had to order another drink on top of the coffee and ice cream 🙈🙈🙈\n\nI don\u0027t know if it\u0027s Taiwan\u0027s business culture like that or just specifically this one shop. I come from SG and despite being an expensive country, no business will tell you how much you have to order. And also, I did order 2 items hahaha... Well at least the coffee was amazing. We stayed at Le Meridien across the street. And although I would love to drink another cup of coffee again from here for the sake of good taste, but the experience today makes me have to reconsider ever coming back again. Will try Simple Kaffa as recommended by my friend instead :)",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
