                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                            "rating":  4,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "We ordered six dishes, most of which are in the top 10 favorites.\n\nOur favorite was the Northern Thai fried fish. It was really delicious! The sauce had a nice balance of tangy and spicy, making it perfect to eat with rice.\n\nHowever, the coffee ribs, which are a specialty at the Nanshan branch, didn’t suit me or my friends. The combination of coffee and ribs didn’t work well for us, and the coffee flavor was too overpowering—tasting more like honey coffee.\n\nThe chicken curry and water spinach were just okay, nothing special.\n\nFor the rice, the turmeric rice was so fragrant 👍",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
