                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "All the breakfast options are delicious,\n\nthe owner\u0027s dedication is evident in every detail.\n\nHighly recommend the stir-fried instant noodles! ❤️\n\nThe owner is always full of energy,\n\nit makes you happy all day.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "各式早餐都非常好吃，\n處處可見老闆的用心。\n\n大推炒泡麵！❤️\n\n老闆總是活力滿滿，\n會讓人開心一整天。",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
