                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "The food was delicious. The spicy rice balls with pickled radish were salty and spicy, and the egg pancakes were also good. The chili sauce, in particular, was homemade and very fragrant. The fried food was also of high quality. The service was good, and the environment was very clean… Thumbs up! 👍",
                                         "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "餐點很好吃，辣味飯糰的辣菜脯鹹 辣好吃，蛋餅也好吃，尤其辣椒醬是老闆自己炒的很香，炸物也很有水準，服務好環境很整潔…推👍",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
