                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Marshall Zen Garden is a historic site that now houses a tea house, a hot spring spa, and a restaurant. It\u0027s unique location provides an excellent sunset view over Taipei. It is quiet and serene and has a hot spring foot pool for those that don\u0027t need the full body submersion.\n\nThe dinner served are all health conscious without sacrificing taste. It is a hidden gem that anyone in the area should visit!",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
