                            "rating":  4,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "In Search Of: Best Coffee in Taipei - Taiwan\n\nThis spot just made it onto my favorites list for 2024! It’s awesome that the owner, Andy, personally came over to check if my drink was okay. Love his vibe and the concept behind his coffee brand. It leans toward the coffee side of the palate, but I absolutely love it. Stay tuned for more in-depth conversations with Andy!\n\nAbsolutely loved both drinks I tried:\n• Guava Lemonade Four Seasons Oolong Tea – Better than some tea shops I’ve been to.\n• 炙烤糰子拿鐵黑糖 (Mochi Latte) – Not too sweet, just perfect!",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
