                            "rating":  2,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Takes at least 30 minutes for each dish to come out (hence the name). We ordered separate dishes so we were sitting around for over an hour waiting then watching one person eat then repeat. Ended up leaving before the last person got his meal because they \"lost\" his order.\nFood was okay, aesthetic but overpriced. I ordered a mascarpone toast for brunch which also came with prosciutto and fruit (weird combo but my fault).\nThe waitress gave us 2 menus for 4 people, told us she\u0027d bring more then forgot.\nDon\u0027t come if you dont have a reservation and don\u0027t order separately.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
