                                                 "text":  "I was surprised when they suddenly asked me, as if they were certain, \"You\u0027re from ***, aren\u0027t you?\" Does that have anything to do with me coming to this cafe? Or, is there a difference in service based on nationality?\n\nYou have to order at least a $350 set per person. I ordered the cake set, and I got a tiny half-frozen cake and coffee in a paper cup. This cost is for interacting with cats, not for enjoying food and drinks.\n\nExcept for a staff with glasses, the other staffs didn\u0027t seem particularly fond of humans. These three stars are for her and the tired cats.",
