                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "The signature \"Black Gold\" Minced Pork Rice is amazing—rich, savory, and the glaze has a great texture.\n\nI also highly recommend the 清湯瓜仔肉; the broth is surprisingly clear and naturally sweet, which balances the richness of the rice perfectly. Don’t skip the Braised Duck Egg—it’s much more fragrant than a regular egg and a must-order side.\n\nFast service and a clean spot in Wanhua. Definitely worth a visit.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
