                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "We arrived 10mins past it\u0027s opening time and waited for 30mins. The welcoming staff林韋樺was clear, efficient and helpful. The flow of ordering was fast. We ordered and paid before being seated so once we sat down, food arrived. Ms 葉宣岑was detail-minded in making sure our orders have completely arrived. Even though the wait was long, the fact that food was great bang for buck made it worthy. We enjoyed the dry noodles, chicken soup and oysters. The mesona and black fungus drink was surprisingly nice (not sweet). A little bonus is the pleasant fragrance in the washroom. The observed dining time is 20-30mins per table. Will come back but maybe arrive before it opens to minimize the waiting time in the queue.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
