                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Beautiful cafe with amazing service staff. Probably one of the most relaxing places I have eaten in my life. The food is great but the vibe is cozy.\n\nSomething very weird happened while I was eating. Three people pulled up in a car, double parked in the bike lane, then smoked cigarettes and threw them on the ground. I decided to confront them and ask why they are littering. They got angry and left. The service staff thanked me for standing up to them. I hope everyone can be mindful of how to properly discard their garbage and cigarettes.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
