                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Food – Great presentation! The taste is unique and delicious.\nService – Superb! The staff are very helpful and even offered a pillow for back support, which was such a nice touch.\nAtmosphere – Gives off a luxurious vibe with a lovely view that really elevates the dining experience.\n\nIt’s definitely on the pricier side, but if you’re feeling a little boujee on your trip, this place is worth the splurge. And don’t skip the rib eye steak fried rice — it’s their best seller for a reason!",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
