                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "This was glorious. I totally get why people rave about guest house. Some highlights:\n\nThe thin beef jerky was so crispy and flavorful. Beef stir was surprisingly so spicy and so good. 水煮魚 is always a fav and this one did not disappoint with the 嘛. Mapo tofu oh my god. I’m not one for tofu, not even mapo tofu, but I could eat endless amounts of this one. Rice noodles just kept ending up in my mouth… I was so full at this point and yet I couldn’t stop. They also perfected the 麻油雞飯 flavor wow",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
