                            "name":  "places/ChIJl7ziPQCvQjQRJyCcG50hMUo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWaFkzTTNNMjlhVlMxNWNrdDNjbHBaYzBadlZuYxAB",
                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                            "rating":  4,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Located inside the Regent Taiwan Hotel in Beitou, this spot dishes out some solid hotpot. Their seafood and meats are super fresh, and once you place your order, the salad bar turns into an AYCE situation. Same with the dessert bar—yes, you can build your own ice cream sundae, and yes, it’s as fun as it sounds. You can even mix up your own soda flavors if you’re feeling creative.\n\nService is very friendly and efficient and the ambiance is pretty nice. Your typical hotel restaurant vibe in Taiwan. Great for big or small groups.\n\nA group of us came here and had a great meal—easy, tasty, and everyone left happy. The hotel also has an onsen, so next time I’m definitely pairing this with a spa day. Hotpot + hot spring? Yes, please.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "Located inside the Regent Taiwan Hotel in Beitou, this spot dishes out some solid hotpot. Their seafood and meats are super fresh, and once you place your order, the salad bar turns into an AYCE situation. Same with the dessert bar—yes, you can build your own ice cream sundae, and yes, it’s as fun as it sounds. You can even mix up your own soda flavors if you’re feeling creative.\n\nService is very friendly and efficient and the ambiance is pretty nice. Your typical hotel restaurant vibe in Taiwan. Great for big or small groups.\n\nA group of us came here and had a great meal—easy, tasty, and everyone left happy. The hotel also has an onsen, so next time I’m definitely pairing this with a spa day. Hotpot + hot spring? Yes, please.",
                                                 "languageCode":  "en"
                                             },
