                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "I arrived to this cafe while exploring the area and it was a nice coincidence.\nI ordered a brown sugar latte and fried chicken.\nThe brown sugar latte was regular as you can find anywhere else BUT the fried chicken was absolutely my favorite, it was so crispy without being oily.\nThe staff was friendly and helpful despite my poor Chinese skills.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
