                            "rating":  1,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Should have read the latest reviews, before coming here. Avoid this place, unfortunately it leaves a bad impression. After ordering Ramen,\nI went to wash my hands and lady was asking me, while I was in a bathroom, if I want tofu and egg. I said, yes since  I thought this will  be part of Ramen. When paying, I realized that these were all extras. So instead of 399, the lady wanted to charge me 699. I protested, since I found it unfair. The lady, who previously was speaking English, \"forgot\" all her english and even started to talk loudly, telling me that \"how can you think that there can be a tofu in ramen\".\nAvoid this place and remember, that whatever the lady offers will require an extra charge.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
