                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "I’ve been here every single time I’m in taipei and I must say I have NEVER been disappointed. A criminally underrated Italian restaurant tucked away in a corner near Taipei Main Station lies one of the best experiences I have ever had.\n\nTo start off, the 2 person dinner set for TWD1480 is extremely worth it. It comes with two soups, one appetizer, one salad, two mains, two desserts and two drinks. I could never find value like this especially from where I’m from, where this would EASILY cost upwards of TWD3000.\n\nSpecial mention to the Pesto Risotto which literally changed my life. I have never eaten risotto this good and I am seriously contemplating moving to Taiwan just to eat this more regularly.\n\nAlso, wonderful and excellent service from the staff here who are very attentive and extremely friendly.\n\nWould I come again? I think the correct question to ask is how many more times am I coming back before I leave.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
