                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "🌟8/10🌟 The environment is welcoming and the staff are friendly. We visited at tea time and luckily we got direct to sit immediately. The dishes presented very decent and nice, the taste is good but not as good as it look like. My personal favourite will be the pancake, the taste of the cream is rich and creamy. Every corner and the vibes are amazing decorated for pictures. (ˊᵒ̴̶̷̤ ꇴ ᵒ̴̶̷̤ˋ)",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
