                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Store is nicely decorated and I enjoyed drinking coffee here. I did enjoy my cup of coffee with tonic. The girl that helped me with my order was very friendly and spoke English. She asked me what I thought of the coffee and showed that they care about their patrons. It’s located in a quiet small street and MRT station is very close by. I would visit again.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
