                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "The breakfast buffet at Island Buffett in the Hilai Hotel Nankang offers a fantastic spread. There\u0027s a wide array of options covering Western, Japanese, and Chinese cuisines. We particularly enjoyed the fresh omelettes and French toast, which were quite decent. The Chinese food selections, including the congee, fried rice, and pork, were of very good quality. As expected in Asia, the service was also great, making for a very pleasant experience.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
