                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Friday, August 8, 2025\n\nSecond Uber Eats Order\n\nUber Exclusive Egg Pancake (Ham) $190.00\n\nUber Exclusive Golden Fried Dumplings $170.00\n\nMushroom Teppanyaki Noodles $55.00\n\nHot and Sour Soup $50.00\n\nNortheastern Scallion Pancake with Sticky Egg $85.00 Spiciness: Mild $0.00\n\nGarlic Toast $30.00\n\nHot Dog $70.00\n\nLarge Iced Milk Tea $25.00\n\n\nThursday, September 1, 2022\n\nFirst Uber Eats Order\n\n[Hot and Sour Soup] Delicious, lots of ingredients\n\n[Mushroom Teppanyaki Noodles] I liked the noodles, but there wasn\u0027t enough sauce\n\n[Radish Cake] Not bad\n\n[Poached Egg] Half-cooked is excellent\n\n[Small Meat Beans] Great!",
                                         "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "2025年08月08日星期五\nUbereat第二次訂購\nUber獨家蛋餅（火腿）$190.00\n\nuber獨家 黃金煎餃$170.00\n\n蘑菇鐵板麵$55.00\n\n酸辣湯$50.00\n\n東北蔥餅黏蛋$85.00\n辣度\n小辣 $0.00\n\n烤香蒜薄片吐司$30.00\n\n熱狗$70.00\n\n大冰奶茶$25.00\n\n2022年09月01日。星期四\nUbereat第一次訂購\n【酸辣湯】\n不錯喝，料也多\n【蘑菇鐵板麵】\n麵條我喜歡，可惜醬太少\n【蘿蔔糕】\n還不錯\n【荷包蛋】\n半熟就是優秀\n【小肉豆】\n讚啦",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
