                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Every staff member was very polite and patient. I heard others say it felt like home, and after visiting the restaurant, I definitely felt that way. There aren\u0027t many good restaurants nearby, so I recommend everyone give it a try.\n\nSirloin: 5/5, Puff Pastry Chowder, Floating Black Tea.\n\nThe meat was very tender, the puff pastry looked great, and the floating black tea was good – you can get refills.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "每個店員都很客氣有耐心，看到其他人說有家的感覺，親自到店裡確實有這樣的感受，附近好吃的也不多，建議大家都來吃吃看。\n沙朗5分、酥皮濃湯、漂浮紅茶。\n肉很嫩，酥皮賣相很好，漂浮紅茶可以可以續紅茶。",
                                                 "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                             },
