                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "We had fun, and it’s a birthday blowout from our September babies friends. We love the ambiance since it is famous already as you can take pictures with taipei 101 from the hooters building. The foods I love is the white Pasta with mushroom, the chickens, not too with the baby back ribs since its dry and no sauce. But overall, the food is good, the view is nice, and entertainment is great. We were thankful that the rain falls heavy when we already got there anyways.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
