                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Fun American sports-bar vibe with a lively atmosphere right in Xinyi District. The menu has classic Hooters favourites — wings, burgers, pasta, salads and more — and people like coming for the cold drinks, tasty food, and great views of Taipei 101 from the outdoor terrace at night. The service is friendly and it’s a good spot for casual hangouts or group dinners.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
