                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "The wings are outstanding. I don’t normally go for wings but I heard about them so had to try and I was not disappointed.\n\nI opted for the boneless and they were so juicy and big! The sauces went well, curry garlic, cheese and bbq. Thinking about it makes me want to go back.\n\nThe atmosphere was fun and the punters were friendly and talkative. The staff also tentative and spoke English well. It was an all round good time and the views are pretty nice too, with 101 right there.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
