                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Had my birthday dinner here and it definitely didn’t disappoint! We went for the 15-course tasting menu, which took about 2.5 hours and was full of creativity and surprises. Every dish was beautifully presented, and the staff explained each course with care. I especially loved the jelly cube - I still remember how the flavors burst in my mouth - and the crispy sweet potato and taro seafood bites, which was fried but not oily at all, just perfectly crispy and fun to eat. Thank you also for the birthday cake ^^",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
