                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Small restaurant with only 6 tables, max capacity 18 pax. Environment is decorated with many wood furniture, chill vibes. Chanced upon it during the rain and the quality of food is better than expected.\n\nOrdered vegetarian pesto and their chef suggestion Chicken cutlet with cream spaghetti. Both spaghetti is soft type and standard veggies (broccoli, baby corn and mushroom). The taste is mild but overall good. Chicken cutlet is crispy and juicy. 👍 The mushroom soup taste like premade pack. Onion rings were really crispy and ketchup is good. Their tea is really good but it\u0027s quite sweet. The foam with alpaca spoon is really cute. Total TWD 790 for 2 pax.\n\nA little expensive and a little deserted.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
