                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "This cafe is a staple source of my beans for home brewing.\nTheir deep knowledge of roasting and brewing is shown both in their drinks and shared by their friendly and welcoming staff.\nTheir beans are very competitively priced, of great quality, roasted properly to express the origin while taming harsheness, come from a variety of under represented origins and most importantly are unapologetically faithful to the origin\u0027s flavor.\nYou\u0027ll always know it\u0027s a summatra blend because it\u0027ll give you that specific cocoa flavor.\n\nIf you want to drink pragmatic coffee where you get 90% of the quality for 60% of the price and explore the world from a bag of beans, this is it.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
