                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "What a legendary restaurant in Taipei city centre area!\n\nIt\u0027s small, it\u0027s ordinary but it\u0027s the taste of memories.\n\nIf you or your family have a military background, this is definitely the restaurant for you\nWithin this tiny place you get to enjoy flavours from different part of China, I mean, decades ago.\n\nAfter all these years they are still priced reasonably, the portion is still good for even one person to eat alone or for two to share more.\n\nNo one single item will disappoint you, just go ahead and order. If you have no idea what to eat, asking around or wait for clerks to recommend.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
