                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "日向洋食 (Hinata) offers refined Japanese-style Western cuisine in an intimate, calm setting. Thoughtfully plated dishes balance comfort and elegance, making it ideal for a slow, special meal.\n\nA minimum spending of NT$200 per person applies, and reservations are required due to limited seating and strong demand.\n\nThe only downside: they accept cash only, which feels a little old-school.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
