                            "name":  "places/ChIJwQvTceOpQjQRhxBKSCWjU6A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WeFJHWlVVRWRrUTI1amNrTTVhRVoyWXkxRFgzYxAB",
                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "10 months ago",
                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "We had our last dinner in Taiwan at Jin Zhu. The interior of the restaurant was beautifully decorated.\n\nWe ordered:\nPork fried rice\nStir fried seasonal veggies\nScallion on chicken\nCrispy fried pork\nBraised pork combo: pork belly \u0026 knuckle\n\nThe food was great, properly cooked and seasoned. I could tell, all the ingredients \u0026 meat were high quality \u0026 \u0027without flaws\u0027 products.\nIt was served beautifully, too. The service was also flawless.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
