                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "I spent a night there, during reservation I wasn’t clearly informed that only a fixed set dinner was available, which was a bit disappointing. The food overall was tasteless, with the exception of the sea bass and beef. The waitstaff introduced each dish very quietly, and even with full attention it was very difficult to hear them. Overall, the experience was fair, but given the relatively high price, it didn’t feel like good value for money.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
