                            "rating":  5,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "Enjoyed this meal!\n\nFor starters, I recommend the butter and bread, the bread is nice and crispy. The potato and clam chowder puff pastry is thick and flavorful, highly recommend.\nFor the main course, I recommend the linguine lobster, I really liked the flavors.\n\nThe only disappointment was the Lamb and Port wine berry sauce. The sauce itself was good, but the lamb meat was not as tender as I had expected it to be.\n\nAlso the desserts were delicious. I ordered the crème brûlée and chocolate cake. Both were absolutely delicious.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
                            "originalText":  {
                                                 "text":  "Enjoyed this meal!\n\nFor starters, I recommend the butter and bread, the bread is nice and crispy. The potato and clam chowder puff pastry is thick and flavorful, highly recommend.\nFor the main course, I recommend the linguine lobster, I really liked the flavors.\n\nThe only disappointment was the Lamb and Port wine berry sauce. The sauce itself was good, but the lamb meat was not as tender as I had expected it to be.\n\nAlso the desserts were delicious. I ordered the crème brûlée and chocolate cake. Both were absolutely delicious.",
                                                 "languageCode":  "en"
                                             },
