                            "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                            "rating":  2,
                            "text":  {
                                         "text":  "The place was crowded, which is a good sign, the servers were also plenty nice and helpful. There were just too many dishes that didn\u0027t look appetizing. Out of ten dishes, one was appealing, the others were room temperature when they should have been hot or cold, or they were not seasoned, or the texture was off. It could have been the lighting, or the impression left by the old building, or I\u0027m spoiled by the exceptional dim sum place I go to back home.",
                                         "languageCode":  "en"
                                     },
